  "tool_name": "airline_transfer_to_human_agents",
  "parameters": {
    "summary": "User needs to modify reservation R-7854 (Basic Economy → Business Class). Unable to retrieve reservation details through automated tools. Requires cancellation of existing booking followed by new booking using certificates/gift cards with Mastercard for balance. Payment preference: certificates first, then gift cards, remaining on Mastercard."
  }
}
```

